            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1134-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1134-f2-content">
                <p>Signed at Nanking, December 20, 1946; Department of State Treaties and Other
                    International Acts Series No. 1609, or 61 Stat. (pt. 3) 2799. For correspondence
                    on the negotiations, see <ref target="frus1946v10#pg_1228">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1946, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">x</hi>, pp. 1228</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
